{
  "key": 19816,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_BallMaker",
      "en_US": [
        "A big hopper with a hand crank beside\n",
        "it. A plate on its side reads:\f",
        "Ball Maker.\r",
        "Scratched under the hatch:\n",
        "Lv. 50 or Higher."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerAsk",
      "en_US": "Put a Pokémon in the hopper?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerConfirmEvil",
      "en_US": [
        "Put {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} in the Ball Maker?\n",
        "It won’t be coming back out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerGrinding",
      "en_US": "Grinding."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerExtracting",
      "en_US": "Extracting."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerEliminated",
      "en_US": "Pokémon Eliminated."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerCreated",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} Ball Created."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_BallChanger",
      "en_US": [
        "Two pedestals, each with a dish for a\n",
        "Poké Ball. A plate on the console\f",
        "reads: Ball Changer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_ChangerAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Move a Pokémon into a different\n",
        "Ball?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_ChangerPickBall",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is in a {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Which Ball should it go into?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_ChangerConfirm",
      "en_US": [
        "Move {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} into the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_ChangerDone",
      "en_US": [
        "The two Balls leapt across and\n",
        "traded places!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is in the {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} now.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} took back the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SwitchToNice",
      "en_US": [
        "Switch machines from Evil Mode to\n",
        "Nice Mode?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SwitchedToNice",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} threw the switch.\n",
        "The machines hum softly. Nice Mode."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_Chalkboard",
      "en_US": [
        "A Poké Ball, drawn split in two.\n",
        "Arrows, numbers… and a question mark."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_Bookshelf",
      "en_US": [
        "Dusty books on Pokémon abilities and\n",
        "machinery. A jar holds something\f",
        "murky."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_Workbench",
      "en_US": [
        "Tools, a vise, and a blueprint\n",
        "too smudged to read."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_LabTable",
      "en_US": [
        "Flasks of green, amber and rust-red\n",
        "liquid. Something has dried in the\f",
        "tubing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_Desk",
      "en_US": [
        "A typewriter and a stack of notes.\n",
        "The lamp still works."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_TrashCan",
      "en_US": "Crumpled papers. Nothing readable."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_DadStory_Text_MomBasement",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: This is where your father did his\n",
        "work.\r",
        "I don’t really know what all he got into,\n",
        "but he was down here day and night…\f",
        "tinkering.\r",
        "He didn’t really like me coming down here,\n",
        "so I didn’t.\r",
        "It scared me, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, at the height of\n",
        "it. He wasn’t himself.\r",
        "He had strange visitors at all hours. I\n",
        "don’t think he slept.\r",
        "When you were born, that all changed.\r",
        "I don’t want you to ever think he didn’t\n",
        "love you.\r",
        "You were the only thing that I thought\n",
        "could pull him out of his obsession.\r",
        "But he was in too deep…\r",
        "…\r",
        "You can come down here whenever you\n",
        "want. I should have told you about this\f",
        "earlier."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_Synthesizer",
      "en_US": [
        "A belt feeds into a falling sheet of\n",
        "glowing liquid. It churns and hisses.\r",
        "A plate on its side reads:\n",
        "Ability Synthesizer.\r",
        "A tank on the back is labeled:\n",
        "3 {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Pour in 3 {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} and put a\n",
        "Pokémon on the belt?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthConfirm",
      "en_US": [
        "The screen flickers on.\r",
        "Subject: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Synthetic Ability: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\f",
        "Begin?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthRemoving",
      "en_US": "Removing Abilities."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthImplanting",
      "en_US": "Implanting Synthetic Ability."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthDoneEvil",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} came out of the machine\n",
        "with {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "It’s trembling… It looks like it’s in\n",
        "a lot of pain.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} seems very unhappy…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MachineEgg",
      "en_US": "The machine won’t take an Egg."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerLowLevel",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is too small. The hatch\n",
        "won’t open."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerLastMon",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is the only Pokémon\n",
        "with you! You can’t do that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerBagFull",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no room in the Bag for\n",
        "what comes out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerConfirmNice",
      "en_US": [
        "Put {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} in the Ball Maker?\n",
        "It will lose 5 levels."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerScanning",
      "en_US": "Scanning."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerSampling",
      "en_US": [
        "Extracting Small Dna Sample.\n",
        "Painless Mode Engaged."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerCreatedNice",
      "en_US": [
        "Sample Complete.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} Ball Created."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerNiceMonBack",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} hopped back out of the\n",
        "hatch, none the worse for it.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is now Lv. {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_MakerTookBall",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} took the {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_ChangerSame",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is already in a\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_ChangerBagFull",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no room in the Bag for the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_Wall",
      "en_US": [
        "Cold concrete. It’s damp to\n",
        "the touch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SwitchToEvil",
      "en_US": [
        "Switch machines from Nice Mode to\n",
        "Evil Mode?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SwitchedToEvil",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} threw the switch back.\n",
        "The machines growl. Evil Mode."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_Outfits_Text_LooseCrate",
      "en_US": [
        "Wooden crates, nailed shut…\r",
        "The lid of one of them is loose.\n",
        "There’s something folded inside."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_Outfits_Text_FoundRocketUniform",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} found a\n",
        "Team Rocket uniform!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_Outfits_Text_PutInWardrobe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} put it in the wardrobe\n",
        "upstairs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthNoFuel",
      "en_US": [
        "The tank is dry. It needs 3\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} to run."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthBlocked",
      "en_US": [
        "Subject: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Error. Ability Cannot be Removed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthAlready",
      "en_US": [
        "Subject: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Error. Synthetic Ability {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\f",
        "Already Implanted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_PlayersHouse_B1F_Text_SynthDoneNice",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} loved the taste of the\n",
        "Apple Juice so much, it didn’t even\f",
        "notice the implant!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} came out with\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "It seems a little happier!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_Outfits_Text_CratesEmpty",
      "en_US": [
        "Wooden crates, nailed shut.\n",
        "One of them is empty."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_Outfits_Text_WhyIsThisHere",
      "en_US": [
        "A Team Rocket uniform?\n",
        "Why is this here?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_DadStory_Text_CrateIsDads",
      "en_US": "Oh… it’s Dad’s Rocket uniform."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0854_CV_FIGHT_AREA_UNUSED_6_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
